OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in tears after flight home
OL,4,Acancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman said she was in tears after her
OL,7,Fflight was cancelled due to air traffic
OL,8,Fcontrol problems, leaving herself and
OL,9,Fher mum stuck in Turkey.
OL,11,FMelissa Green, 27, from Newcastle, was
OL,12,Fsupposed to fly home yesterday with her
OL,13,Fmum Lisa Burford following a holiday in
OL,14,FMarmaris, but the journey did not go
OL,15,Fahead after an issue with UK air
OL,16,Ftraffic control systems.
OL,18,FAir traffic control provider Nats has
OL,19,Fapologised after nearly 2,000 flights
OL,20,Fwere cancelled on Tuesday with almost
OL,21,F300 more cancelled so far on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
