OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in tears after flight home
OL,4,Acancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen, who has since managed to book a
OL,7,Freturn flight for Saturday, said she
OL,8,Fhad a "complete and utter mental
OL,9,Fbreakdown" as her flight got cancelled
OL,10,Ffollowing several delays.
